            </note>
            <note corresp="#d426-f2" n="1" xml:id="d426-f2-content">
                <p>According to Kennedy’s appointment book, this meeting lasted until 12:03 p.m.
                    (Kennedy Library, President’s Appointment Book).</p>
            </note>
